{"id":"forecast-15","section":1,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-15/audio-1.m4a","model":"small","duration":398.73,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":6.42,"text":"You will hear a number of different recordings, and you will have to answer questions on what you hear.","words":[["You",0.0,0.52],["will",0.52,0.72],["hear",0.72,1.0],["a",1.0,1.18],["number",1.18,1.54],["of",1.54,1.8],["different",1.8,2.14],["recordings,",2.14,2.68],["and",3.18,3.64],["you",3.64,3.82],["will",3.82,3.94],["have",3.94,4.14],["to",4.14,4.3],["answer",4.3,4.64],["questions",4.64,5.2],["on",5.2,5.62],["what",5.62,5.84],["you",5.84,6.04],["hear.",6.04,6.42]]},{"start":7.46,"end":13.88,"text":"There will be time for you to read the instructions and questions, and you will have a chance to check your work.","words":[["There",7.46,7.74],["will",7.74,7.86],["be",7.86,8.0],["time",8.0,8.38],["for",8.38,8.68],["you",8.68,8.78],["to",8.78,8.86],["read",8.86,9.2],["the",9.2,9.44],["instructions",9.44,10.02],["and",10.02,10.38],["questions,",10.38,10.74],["and",11.22,11.9],["you",11.9,12.06],["will",12.06,12.18],["have",12.18,12.34],["a",12.34,12.46],["chance",12.46,12.74],["to",12.74,12.96],["check",12.96,13.3],["your",13.3,13.5],["work.",13.5,13.88]]},{"start":15.04,"end":18.46,"text":"All the recordings will be played once only.","words":[["All",15.04,15.38],["the",15.38,15.52],["recordings",15.52,15.96],["will",15.96,16.64],["be",16.64,16.78],["played",16.78,17.24],["once",17.24,17.76],["only.",17.76,18.46]]},{"start":19.78,"end":25.8,"text":"The test is in four parts. Write all your answers in the listening question booklet.","words":[["The",19.78,19.98],["test",19.98,20.34],["is",20.34,21.04],["in",21.04,21.18],["four",21.18,21.54],["parts.",21.54,22.16],["Write",22.78,23.1],["all",23.1,23.38],["your",23.38,23.52],["answers",23.52,23.96],["in",23.96,24.32],["the",24.32,24.44],["listening",24.44,24.82],["question",24.82,25.32],["booklet.",25.32,25.8]]},{"start":25.8,"end":31.64,"text":"booklet. At the end of the test, you will be given ten minutes to transfer your answers","words":[["booklet.",25.8,25.9],["At",26.6,27.08],["the",27.08,27.2],["end",27.2,27.46],["of",27.46,27.56],["the",27.56,27.66],["test,",27.66,28.02],["you",28.46,28.68],["will",28.68,28.8],["be",28.8,28.96],["given",28.96,29.2],["ten",29.2,29.62],["minutes",29.62,30.04],["to",30.04,30.42],["transfer",30.42,30.96],["your",30.96,31.2],["answers",31.2,31.64]]},{"start":31.64,"end":44.99,"text":"to an answer sheet. Now turn to part one on page two of your question booklet. Part one.","words":[["to",31.64,31.98],["an",31.98,32.14],["answer",32.14,32.48],["sheet.",32.48,32.84],["Now",34.86,35.26],["turn",35.26,35.52],["to",35.52,35.74],["part",35.74,35.94],["one",35.94,36.3],["on",36.3,37.1],["page",37.1,37.46],["two",37.46,37.96],["of",37.96,38.2],["your",38.2,38.3],["question",38.3,38.64],["booklet.",38.64,39.08],["Part",44.39,44.57],["one.",44.57,44.99]]},{"start":46.21,"end":51.93,"text":"You will hear a telephone conversation between a woman who is moving to London and an employee","words":[["You",46.21,46.55],["will",46.55,46.73],["hear",46.73,46.97],["a",46.97,47.15],["telephone",47.15,47.53],["conversation",47.53,48.31],["between",48.31,48.77],["a",48.77,48.99],["woman",48.99,49.23],["who",49.23,49.53],["is",49.53,49.65],["moving",49.65,49.91],["to",49.91,50.21],["London",50.21,50.49],["and",50.49,51.35],["an",51.35,51.51],["employee",51.51,51.93]]},{"start":51.93,"end":58.09,"text":"of a relocation service. First you have some time to look at questions one to seven.","words":[["of",51.93,52.31],["a",52.31,52.45],["relocation",52.45,53.07],["service.",53.07,53.53],["First",54.55,55.15],["you",55.15,55.37],["have",55.37,55.55],["some",55.55,55.71],["time",55.71,56.09],["to",56.09,56.35],["look",56.35,56.53],["at",56.53,56.69],["questions",56.69,57.05],["one",57.05,57.51],["to",57.51,57.73],["seven.",57.73,58.09]]},{"start":58.09,"end":96.18,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions one to seven.","words":[["Now",58.09,59.19],["listen",92.98,93.46],["carefully",93.46,93.96],["and",93.96,94.32],["answer",94.32,94.7],["questions",94.7,95.1],["one",95.1,95.58],["to",95.58,95.8],["seven.",95.8,96.18]]},{"start":100.02,"end":103.98,"text":"London Relocation Services, Daniel speaking. How may I help you?","words":[["London",100.02,100.46],["Relocation",100.46,100.96],["Services,",100.96,101.7],["Daniel",102.02,102.26],["speaking.",102.26,102.62],["How",103.18,103.32],["may",103.32,103.46],["I",103.46,103.58],["help",103.58,103.76],["you?",103.76,103.98]]},{"start":104.6,"end":110.12,"text":"Good morning. My family and I are moving to London later this year and I wonder if you can help.","words":[["Good",104.6,104.88],["morning.",104.88,105.16],["My",105.68,105.88],["family",105.88,106.26],["and",106.26,106.42],["I",106.42,106.56],["are",106.56,106.64],["moving",106.64,106.9],["to",106.9,107.18],["London",107.18,107.46],["later",107.46,107.84],["this",107.84,108.12],["year",108.12,108.4],["and",108.4,108.76],["I",108.76,109.02],["wonder",109.02,109.32],["if",109.32,109.48],["you",109.48,109.62],["can",109.62,109.8],["help.",109.8,110.12]]},{"start":110.5,"end":116.16,"text":"Sure. First of all, I'll need to get some personal details. May I take your full name, please?","words":[["Sure.",110.5,110.86],["First",111.32,111.6],["of",111.6,111.8],["all,",111.8,112.0],["I'll",112.16,112.34],["need",112.34,112.52],["to",112.52,112.72],["get",112.72,112.86],["some",112.86,113.02],["personal",113.02,113.46],["details.",113.46,113.92],["May",114.5,114.7],["I",114.7,114.84],["take",114.84,115.08],["your",115.08,115.26],["full",115.26,115.52],["name,",115.52,115.84],["please?",115.96,116.16]]},{"start":116.78,"end":117.82,"text":"It's Anna Woods.","words":[["It's",116.78,117.18],["Anna",117.18,117.46],["Woods.",117.46,117.82]]},{"start":118.56,"end":120.58,"text":"Thanks. Where are you moving from?","words":[["Thanks.",118.56,118.9],["Where",119.6,119.9],["are",119.9,120.0],["you",120.0,120.08],["moving",120.08,120.28],["from?",120.28,120.58]]},{"start":121.14,"end":124.0,"text":"Northern Ireland. Just outside Belfast, actually.","words":[["Northern",121.14,121.48],["Ireland.",121.48,121.86],["Just",122.26,122.56],["outside",122.56,123.02],["Belfast,",123.02,123.56],["actually.",123.66,124.0]]},{"start":124.0,"end":126.94,"text":"Right. And what's your current address?","words":[["Right.",124.0,124.66],["And",125.2,125.6],["what's",125.6,126.0],["your",126.0,126.1],["current",126.1,126.58],["address?",126.58,126.94]]},{"start":127.58,"end":139.46,"text":"It's 118 Fordeis Park. I'll spell that for you. It's F-O-R-D-Y-C-E. And that's in Balicillin.","words":[["It's",127.58,127.92],["118",127.92,129.12],["Fordeis",129.12,130.06],["Park.",130.06,130.38],["I'll",130.9,131.18],["spell",131.18,131.38],["that",131.38,131.62],["for",131.62,131.86],["you.",131.86,132.1],["It's",132.72,133.04],["F",133.04,133.52],["-O",133.52,134.02],["-R",134.02,134.62],["-D",134.62,135.6],["-Y",135.6,136.28],["-C",136.28,136.94],["-E.",136.94,137.44],["And",137.98,138.28],["that's",138.28,138.66],["in",138.66,138.78],["Balicillin.",138.78,139.46]]},{"start":139.88,"end":141.4,"text":"And what's the postcode?","words":[["And",139.88,140.44],["what's",140.44,140.82],["the",140.82,140.92],["postcode?",140.92,141.4]]},{"start":142.12,"end":145.54,"text":"It's BT149BJ.","words":[["It's",142.12,142.48],["BT149BJ.",142.48,145.54]]},{"start":146.16,"end":149.66,"text":"Alright. And could I take a contact phone number?","words":[["Alright.",146.16,146.68],["And",147.24,147.54],["could",147.54,147.82],["I",147.82,148.04],["take",148.04,148.28],["a",148.28,148.54],["contact",148.54,148.98],["phone",148.98,149.3],["number?",149.3,149.66]]},{"start":149.66,"end":160.62,"text":"I'll give you my mobile number as you can get me on that any time. It's 07 8400 51963.","words":[["I'll",149.66,150.58],["give",150.58,150.76],["you",150.76,150.96],["my",150.96,151.14],["mobile",151.14,151.5],["number",151.5,152.02],["as",152.02,152.42],["you",152.42,152.58],["can",152.58,152.74],["get",152.74,152.94],["me",152.94,153.1],["on",153.1,153.3],["that",153.3,153.46],["any",153.46,153.76],["time.",153.76,154.12],["It's",154.82,155.16],["07",155.16,155.98],["8400",155.98,157.52],["51963.",157.52,160.62]]},{"start":161.22,"end":167.4,"text":"Great. Got that. Now we always like to get a bit more information about the families that we're moving.","words":[["Great.",161.22,161.74],["Got",162.18,162.34],["that.",162.34,162.58],["Now",163.24,163.52],["we",163.52,163.82],["always",163.82,164.12],["like",164.12,164.38],["to",164.38,164.5],["get",164.5,164.64],["a",164.64,164.74],["bit",164.74,164.86],["more",164.86,165.1],["information",165.1,165.72],["about",165.72,166.04],["the",166.04,166.24],["families",166.24,166.6],["that",166.6,166.86],["we're",166.86,167.08],["moving.",167.08,167.4]]},{"start":167.82,"end":170.62,"text":"It helps with the search. Are you moving for work?","words":[["It",167.82,167.98],["helps",167.98,168.2],["with",168.2,168.38],["the",168.38,168.52],["search.",168.52,168.88],["Are",169.5,169.7],["you",169.7,169.86],["moving",169.86,170.16],["for",170.16,170.36],["work?",170.36,170.62]]},{"start":171.24,"end":173.7,"text":"Yes, my husband's just got a new job in London.","words":[["Yes,",171.24,171.54],["my",171.64,171.8],["husband's",171.8,172.34],["just",172.34,172.5],["got",172.5,172.74],["a",172.74,172.88],["new",172.88,173.04],["job",173.04,173.28],["in",173.28,173.42],["London.",173.42,173.7]]},{"start":174.06,"end":175.86,"text":"And what about you? Do you work?","words":[["And",174.06,174.42],["what",174.42,174.58],["about",174.58,174.84],["you?",174.84,175.14],["Do",175.38,175.46],["you",175.46,175.58],["work?",175.58,175.86]]},{"start":175.86,"end":181.26,"text":"Well, I've been working as a teaching assistant recently, but I'm actually a qualified nurse","words":[["Well,",175.86,176.64],["I've",176.82,176.98],["been",176.98,177.1],["working",177.1,177.42],["as",177.42,177.64],["a",177.64,177.76],["teaching",177.76,178.02],["assistant",178.02,178.42],["recently,",178.42,179.06],["but",179.42,179.68],["I'm",179.68,179.94],["actually",179.94,180.24],["a",180.24,180.4],["qualified",180.4,180.8],["nurse",180.8,181.26]]},{"start":181.26,"end":183.7,"text":"and I'd like to get back into that if possible.","words":[["and",181.26,181.72],["I'd",181.72,182.04],["like",182.04,182.18],["to",182.18,182.36],["get",182.36,182.5],["back",182.5,182.72],["into",182.72,182.94],["that",182.94,183.2],["if",183.2,183.32],["possible.",183.32,183.7]]},{"start":184.14,"end":184.44,"text":"Right.","words":[["Right.",184.14,184.44]]},{"start":184.94,"end":186.72,"text":"And do you have any children?","words":[["And",184.94,185.36],["do",185.36,185.72],["you",185.72,185.92],["have",185.92,186.16],["any",186.16,186.34],["children?",186.34,186.72]]},{"start":187.28,"end":190.04,"text":"Yes, a son, so we need to find a school for him.","words":[["Yes,",187.28,187.54],["a",187.72,187.82],["son,",187.82,188.0],["so",188.4,188.6],["we",188.6,188.78],["need",188.78,188.92],["to",188.92,189.08],["find",189.08,189.28],["a",189.28,189.38],["school",189.38,189.62],["for",189.62,189.82],["him.",189.82,190.04]]},{"start":190.44,"end":192.48,"text":"Is it a secondary school you'll be looking for?","words":[["Is",190.44,190.62],["it",190.62,190.78],["a",190.78,190.92],["secondary",190.92,191.2],["school",191.2,191.62],["you'll",191.62,191.82],["be",191.82,191.9],["looking",191.9,192.12],["for?",192.12,192.48]]},{"start":192.96,"end":194.62,"text":"No, he's still in primary school.","words":[["No,",192.96,193.26],["he's",193.42,193.62],["still",193.62,193.78],["in",193.78,193.92],["primary",193.92,194.2],["school.",194.2,194.62]]},{"start":195.08,"end":197.0,"text":"He's not quite at the secondary level yet.","words":[["He's",195.08,195.34],["not",195.34,195.48],["quite",195.48,195.72],["at",195.72,195.92],["the",195.92,196.02],["secondary",196.02,196.38],["level",196.38,196.72],["yet.",196.72,197.0]]},{"start":197.38,"end":197.72,"text":"Fine.","words":[["Fine.",197.38,197.72]]},{"start":198.54,"end":201.86,"text":"So, let's go on to talk about your requirements for the property.","words":[["So,",198.54,198.82],["let's",198.98,199.44],["go",199.44,199.56],["on",199.56,199.72],["to",199.72,199.88],["talk",199.88,200.06],["about",200.06,200.34],["your",200.34,200.54],["requirements",200.54,201.08],["for",201.08,201.38],["the",201.38,201.48],["property.",201.48,201.86]]},{"start":202.34,"end":203.94,"text":"Do you have a preferred location?","words":[["Do",202.34,202.54],["you",202.54,202.7],["have",202.7,202.86],["a",202.86,202.96],["preferred",202.96,203.28],["location?",203.28,203.94]]},{"start":203.94,"end":205.94,"text":"Is your husband's job in the centre?","words":[["Is",203.94,204.5],["your",204.5,204.68],["husband's",204.68,205.24],["job",205.24,205.42],["in",205.42,205.56],["the",205.56,205.68],["centre?",205.68,205.94]]},{"start":206.72,"end":208.04,"text":"No, it's in East London.","words":[["No,",206.72,206.94],["it's",207.1,207.34],["in",207.34,207.46],["East",207.46,207.74],["London.",207.74,208.04]]},{"start":208.52,"end":210.48,"text":"But we'd rather live somewhere quieter.","words":[["But",208.52,208.8],["we'd",208.8,209.14],["rather",209.14,209.38],["live",209.38,209.58],["somewhere",209.58,209.96],["quieter.",209.96,210.48]]},{"start":211.0,"end":213.38,"text":"Sure. There are some lovely areas in the south.","words":[["Sure.",211.0,211.28],["There",211.64,211.86],["are",211.86,211.96],["some",211.96,212.1],["lovely",212.1,212.38],["areas",212.38,212.86],["in",212.86,213.0],["the",213.0,213.1],["south.",213.1,213.38]]},{"start":213.9,"end":215.02,"text":"Okay, that sounds great.","words":[["Okay,",213.9,214.24],["that",214.34,214.46],["sounds",214.46,214.68],["great.",214.68,215.02]]},{"start":216.0,"end":219.7,"text":"Now, my husband doesn't want to spend too long commuting to work every day.","words":[["Now,",216.0,216.22],["my",216.3,216.46],["husband",216.46,216.8],["doesn't",216.8,217.14],["want",217.14,217.28],["to",217.28,217.46],["spend",217.46,217.64],["too",217.64,218.0],["long",218.0,218.18],["commuting",218.18,218.68],["to",218.68,218.94],["work",218.94,219.14],["every",219.14,219.4],["day.",219.4,219.7]]},{"start":220.0,"end":225.66,"text":"So, I imagine that ideally he'd like to be not too far from a station then.","words":[["So,",220.0,220.44],["I",220.62,220.76],["imagine",220.76,221.24],["that",221.24,221.62],["ideally",221.62,222.3],["he'd",222.3,223.26],["like",223.26,223.48],["to",223.48,223.7],["be",223.7,223.84],["not",223.84,224.14],["too",224.14,224.44],["far",224.44,224.74],["from",224.74,224.92],["a",224.92,225.1],["station",225.1,225.38],["then.",225.38,225.66]]},{"start":225.98,"end":229.72,"text":"Yes, he drives now but I guess that's not going to be possible","words":[["Yes,",225.98,226.3],["he",226.72,226.92],["drives",226.92,227.32],["now",227.32,227.62],["but",227.62,227.84],["I",227.84,228.1],["guess",228.1,228.38],["that's",228.38,228.72],["not",228.72,228.84],["going",228.84,229.0],["to",229.0,229.12],["be",229.12,229.26],["possible",229.26,229.72]]},{"start":229.72,"end":231.3,"text":"and he's not keen on buses.","words":[["and",229.72,230.3],["he's",230.3,230.5],["not",230.5,230.62],["keen",230.62,230.84],["on",230.84,231.02],["buses.",231.02,231.3]]},{"start":231.3,"end":237.2,"text":"Oh, what about you or your son? Do you have any preferences? Does your son do any sport, for example?","words":[["Oh,",231.3,232.02],["what",232.08,232.26],["about",232.26,232.48],["you",232.48,232.78],["or",232.78,232.94],["your",232.94,233.08],["son?",233.08,233.36],["Do",233.52,233.6],["you",233.6,233.72],["have",233.72,233.88],["any",233.88,233.98],["preferences?",233.98,234.38],["Does",234.96,235.14],["your",235.14,235.32],["son",235.32,235.64],["do",235.64,235.88],["any",235.88,236.14],["sport,",236.14,236.58],["for",236.72,236.82],["example?",236.82,237.2]]},{"start":237.76,"end":244.58,"text":"He's quite active, so I'm sure he'd love a park nearby to run around in. He doesn't do swimming or anything like that.","words":[["He's",237.76,238.06],["quite",238.06,238.22],["active,",238.22,238.72],["so",239.12,239.3],["I'm",239.3,239.56],["sure",239.56,239.78],["he'd",239.78,240.0],["love",240.0,240.12],["a",240.12,240.24],["park",240.24,240.58],["nearby",240.58,240.88],["to",240.88,241.24],["run",241.24,241.42],["around",241.42,241.74],["in.",241.74,241.96],["He",242.46,242.62],["doesn't",242.62,242.92],["do",242.92,243.08],["swimming",243.08,243.46],["or",243.46,243.7],["anything",243.7,243.98],["like",243.98,244.22],["that.",244.22,244.58]]},{"start":245.06,"end":245.44,"text":"Great.","words":[["Great.",245.06,245.44]]},{"start":248.96,"end":272.32,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the conversation, you have some time to look at questions 8 to 10. Now listen and answer questions 8 to 10.","words":[["Before",248.96,249.26],["you",249.26,249.52],["hear",249.52,249.76],["the",249.76,249.9],["rest",249.9,250.12],["of",250.12,250.24],["the",250.24,250.34],["conversation,",250.34,250.9],["you",251.5,251.68],["have",251.68,251.86],["some",251.86,252.02],["time",252.02,252.42],["to",252.42,252.62],["look",252.62,252.76],["at",252.76,252.9],["questions",252.9,253.26],["8",253.26,253.82],["to",253.82,254.0],["10.",254.0,254.36],["Now",269.32,269.68],["listen",269.68,269.94],["and",269.94,270.28],["answer",270.28,270.62],["questions",270.62,271.1],["8",271.1,271.74],["to",271.74,271.92],["10.",271.92,272.32]]},{"start":275.77,"end":278.29,"text":"So what sort of property do you have in mind?","words":[["So",275.77,276.15],["what",276.15,276.55],["sort",276.55,276.75],["of",276.75,276.93],["property",276.93,277.31],["do",277.31,277.61],["you",277.61,277.73],["have",277.73,277.87],["in",277.87,277.99],["mind?",277.99,278.29]]},{"start":278.29,"end":281.15,"text":"clean